{"id":"deprisa","lemma":"deprisa","pos":"adv","rank":1271,"glosses":["quickly, hurriedly"],"ipa":"/deˈpɾisa/","examples":[{"text":"No lo haré deprisa.","en":"I won't do it in a hurry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456701","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]},{"text":"Ven deprisa.","en":"Come quick!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/502631","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null]},{"text":"Todo ocurrió demasiado deprisa.","en":"Everything happened too quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451409","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"too much"},null]},{"text":"El mundo cambia cada vez más deprisa.","en":"The world is changing more and more quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692464","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"world, earth"},{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"increasingly"]]},{"text":"Conducís muy deprisa.","en":"You drive too fast.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448699","words":[{"g":"to drive","l":"conducir"},null,null]}]}